  "Q00074_SagaOfTheDreadnought/7-01.htm": {
   "file": "Q00074_SagaOfTheDreadnought/7-01.htm",
   "quest": 74,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: As you near the Tablet of Vision, you sense a presence. It must be a guardian, whose only purpose is to deny Humans the ultimate knowledge! You fear that you must find a way to defeat this foe beyond what you already know. The past may hold the key. What would Leona do?",
