   ],
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00067_SagaOfTheDoombringer/7-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00067_SagaOfTheDoombringer/7-02.htm",
   "quest": 67,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Vision Guard Eranus? What was I thinking? He must be the winged one I sensed before.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00067_SagaOfTheDoombringer/7-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00067_SagaOfTheDoombringer/7-03.htm",
   "quest": 67,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Eranus is still attacking you! Defeat her first!",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00067_SagaOfTheDoombringer/7-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00067_SagaOfTheDoombringer/7-04.htm",
   "quest": 67,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: You sense a disturbance near the tablet. The time hasn't yet come for you to prove yourself. Come back later.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00067_SagaOfTheDoombringer/7-06.htm": {
   "file": "Q00067_SagaOfTheDoombringer/7-06.htm",
   "quest": 67,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Thoughts beyond your understanding race through you mind. You see a vision of a woman in a blue dress... The location of the next Resonance Amulet flashes into your mind! It is in the possession of Master Digler in the Town of Goddard.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00070_SagaOfThePhoenixKnight/7-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00070_SagaOfThePhoenixKnight/7-02.htm",
   "quest": 70,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: A heavy sensation grips you tightly. The one who sacrificed everything for victory! Victory in battle was his only desire! Can you defeat him? Could you possibly win against such an opponent?",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00070_SagaOfThePhoenixKnight/7-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00070_SagaOfThePhoenixKnight/7-03.htm",
   "quest": 70,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: The time has come to examine the Tablet of Vision. Adil's attack is coming constantly! Defeat him first!",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00070_SagaOfThePhoenixKnight/7-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00070_SagaOfThePhoenixKnight/7-04.htm",
   "quest": 70,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: You sense a disturbance near the tablet. The time hasn't yet come for you to prove yourself. Come back later.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00070_SagaOfThePhoenixKnight/7-06.htm": {
   "file": "Q00070_SagaOfThePhoenixKnight/7-06.htm",
   "quest": 70,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Countless thoughts beyond comprehension sear painfully into your brain. You hear the faint whisper of a woman's voice. A vision appears... A handsome young knight, entering Aden Castle Town with a Stone of Commune! Could it be... Sedrick?",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00074_SagaOfTheDreadnought/7-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00074_SagaOfTheDreadnought/7-02.htm",
   "quest": 74,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: The woman who would deny Humans the power of dragons has sent soldiers to enforce her will. White Wing Combat Corps forever!",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00074_SagaOfTheDreadnought/7-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00074_SagaOfTheDreadnought/7-03.htm",
   "quest": 74,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: The tablet means nothing until we defeat the guardian! Destroy the guardian and take his Stone of Commune!",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00074_SagaOfTheDreadnought/7-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00074_SagaOfTheDreadnought/7-04.htm",
   "quest": 74,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: You sense a disturbance near the Tablet of Vision. Now isn't the time to prove yourself.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00074_SagaOfTheDreadnought/7-06.htm": {
   "file": "Q00074_SagaOfTheDreadnought/7-06.htm",
   "quest": 74,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Countless thoughts beyond comprehension sear painfully into your brain. You hear the faint whisper of a woman's voice. A vision appears... It's Grand Master Bernhart of the Warrior Guild in Goddard Castle Town! The Stone of Commune lies weakening in his powerful grasp...",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00078_SagaOfTheDoomcryer/7-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00078_SagaOfTheDoomcryer/7-02.htm",
   "quest": 78,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Mudaha, slavering and deranged, once claimed to be the Warcryer Sharuhi!",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00078_SagaOfTheDoomcryer/7-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00078_SagaOfTheDoomcryer/7-03.htm",
   "quest": 78,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: The hieroglyphs are indecipherable. Mudaha's attack continues!",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00078_SagaOfTheDoomcryer/7-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00078_SagaOfTheDoomcryer/7-04.htm",
   "quest": 78,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: You sense a disturbance near the tablet. The time hasn't yet come for you to prove yourself.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00078_SagaOfTheDoomcryer/7-06.htm": {
   "file": "Q00078_SagaOfTheDoomcryer/7-06.htm",
   "quest": 78,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Countless thoughts beyond comprehension sear painfully into your brain. You hear the faint whisper of a woman's voice. The temptation of Varangkam brought forth the ability to maintain control over the spirit. Ghosts are divine and full of power. Ironically, they can still be quit…",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00082_SagaOfTheSagittarius/7-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00082_SagaOfTheSagittarius/7-02.htm",
   "quest": 82,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: It's Ezekiel! I read about him in a book!",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00082_SagaOfTheSagittarius/7-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00082_SagaOfTheSagittarius/7-03.htm",
   "quest": 82,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Ezekiel must be dealt with first.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00082_SagaOfTheSagittarius/7-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00082_SagaOfTheSagittarius/7-04.htm",
   "quest": 82,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Someone else is currently communing with the stone. Come back later.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00082_SagaOfTheSagittarius/7-06.htm": {
   "file": "Q00082_SagaOfTheSagittarius/7-06.htm",
   "quest": 82,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: You feel a strange, incomplete force enter your body. A vision shapes itself in your mind. A man is there, engulfed in a dark aura. It seems he is on the road to Goddard Castle from the Wall of Argos! You feel the Tablet of Vision weakening.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00088_SagaOfTheArchmage/7-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00088_SagaOfTheArchmage/7-02.htm",
   "quest": 88,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: The suspicious person must be Allector! Therefore he must have the Stone of Commune.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00088_SagaOfTheArchmage/7-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00088_SagaOfTheArchmage/7-03.htm",
   "quest": 88,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: The time has come to get the first Stone of Commune. Destroy Allector and take his stone.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00088_SagaOfTheArchmage/7-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00088_SagaOfTheArchmage/7-04.htm",
   "quest": 88,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Someone nearby must have the Stone of Commune! It's too noisy now. Try again later when things quiet down a bit.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00088_SagaOfTheArchmage/7-06.htm": {
   "file": "Q00088_SagaOfTheArchmage/7-06.htm",
   "quest": 88,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Countless thoughts beyond comprehension sear painfully into your brain. A vision appears of a woman in blue. The location of the next Stone of Commune suddenly becomes clear! Magister Justin in Goddard Castle Town has it!",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
