   "quest": 94,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Countless thoughts beyond comprehension sear painfully into your brain. A vision appears of a woman in blue. Suddenly the location of the next Stone of Commune becomes clear. High Priest Gregory in Goddard Castle Town has it! Get it from him!",
